        <item>
            <title>3.17.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:53:45 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>198</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.17.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- New worktrees are filed under the right repository name for submodules, bare repositories and checkouts whose folder starts with a dot or ends in `.git`.
- A session from a removed worktree reopens in the checkout that worktree was actually cut from, instead of any checkout that shares its name. A worktree whose repository has another checkout of the same name no longer fails to start because the folder is taken.
- Launcher: picking an existing worktree that has since been deleted refreshes the list instead of switching to a missing folder; "No worktree" is unavailable when there is no main checkout to return to; same-named worktrees show their parent folder; menu checkmarks no longer log missing-symbol warnings.
]]></description>
