        <item>
            <title>3.17.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:35:39 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>196</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.17.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The launcher's worktree chip now lists the repository's existing worktrees; picking one starts the session there. "No worktree" returns to the main checkout, and the chip reads "Existing worktree" while one is selected.

### Changes
- Slack: a session bound to a Slack thread now receives every reply in that thread; nothing is posted back to Slack any more. Other people's replies run read-only; the owner's run like a prompt typed on the Mac.
]]></description>
